  "bodyHash": "b57f9e7c5c0c7a87",
  "content": "<center>  \n\n![神話金屬](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/logo-banner.png)\n\n<section>\n神話金屬是一款關於探索新礦物、將它們熔鍊成錠和合金，進而製成你最愛工具和護甲的《我的世界》模組。\n\n</section>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/ores-and-metals-banner.png\" alt=\"礦石與金屬\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">\n\n此模組中的礦石各自開墾獨特的地下空間。甚至地獄與終界也有！\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/cave-screenshot.png\" alt=\"阿當米特、米瑟里爾、凱德瑞爾姆、銀礦\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\">\n\n蒐集足夠的礦石後，可以透過熔爐或合金鑄爐，將它們轉為稀有金屬或獨特合金。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/alloy-forgery.png\" alt=\"深板岩合金鑄爐及其介面\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\">\n</section>\n<br>  \n<br>  \n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/tools-and-armor-banner.png\" alt=\"工具與護甲\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">   \n\n比下界合金更強力的劍、能鑿穿黑曜石的錘子，以及可成長的護甲。這些裝備皆由金屬製作並可crafted。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/legendary-banglum-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"273\" alt=\"玩家使用傳奇級Banglum錘破牆\">  \n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/armor-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" alt=\"手持神聖之劍並穿戴全套Prometheum護甲的玩家\">\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals#credits\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/credits-banner.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" alt=\"貢獻者名單\" >\n</a>\n\n該專案得以實現多虧眾人的努力，感謝所有貢獻者！點擊上方查看完整名單。\n\n</section>\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/69cKvQWScC \">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/discord-banner.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"93\" alt=\"Wraith Coding Session 專屬Discord圖文\">\n</a>\n</center>",
